    <paragraph>Identify Integers, Rational Numbers, Irrational Numbers, and Real Numbers</paragraph>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, list the ⓐ whole numbers, ⓑ integers, ⓒ rational numbers, ⓓ irrational numbers, ⓔ real numbers for each set of numbers.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="297" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$-8,0,1.95286...,\frac{12}{5},\sqrt{36},9$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$0,36,90,36,9$$ ⓑ $$-8,0,36,9-8,0,36,9$$ ⓒ $$-8,0,125,36,9-8,0,125,36,9$$ ⓓ $$1.95286...,1.95286...,$$ ⓔ $$-8,0,1.95286...,125,36,9-8,0,1.95286...,125,36,9$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
